# x86 / Ubuntu-generic-only patches

These patches were carried when this packaging tracked the Ubuntu generic
kernel for amd64. They are not applied when building against Ubuntu Asahi
(`asahi-arm` on arm64), because they target x86 KVM (SVM/VMX/EPT), Intel
IOMMU Ubuntu SAUCE, or AMD display code that is not relevant for Apple silicon.

Keep them here for reference if amd64 support is restored later, or if
individual fixes are ported to a different base.
